{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0ca2535e9cd3aefa16624b70b766816eb9d102ca625e13b0048fdbce44f7a110"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"First-run setup can configure a primary inference provider and optional backup, discovering models from the provider and supporting API keys, custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints, or Codex/Grok Build logins; reopened via the settings key."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1fd614cc3c0aa6da097b4ddff74c6cdfdf6c90e08d40e958ebd47715400d9b9a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"dmux manages multiple AI coding agents in parallel, giving each task a tmux pane backed by its own isolated git worktree and branch, with merge or GitHub PR actions to bring work back."},{"claim_ids":["clm_25f1318024e3c5f39e490b50c2837f71d733d0fc13fae68b439dfd79956b8413"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"dmux supports launching many agent CLIs, including Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Cline, Gemini, Qwen, Amp, pi, Cursor, Copilot, and Crush, with multi-select of several agents per prompt."},{"claim_ids":["clm_30ebe052a252f4f3d418e66abc46856e4df763a60814ec8cd706a230d16b190c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Each pane is a full working copy in its own worktree so agents do not conflict; merging auto-commits, merges, and cleans up in one step."},{"claim_ids":["clm_31fa6019a9afaeb2a140f3728cfda459cc486dbe77acef77d1f279fe087c33fe"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The TUI exposes single-key shortcuts: n for a new worktree pane, t for a terminal pane, m for the pane menu, f for file browsing, s for settings, and q to quit, among others."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ad52f889b36563b378c4d8e21d39598c8fbd65f030586f6ad710404c5dedba7f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Branch handling defaults to automatic worktree/branch naming, but users can optionally pick a different base branch per pane or supply an explicit name, with agent-specific suffixes for multi-agent launches."},{"claim_ids":["clm_de5e65aff50500448b78c8245d5fd64dad7ecafc4096a7681d7e636491bca986"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Runtime requirements are tmux 3.0+, Node.js 18+, Git 2.20+, at least one supported agent CLI, and optionally an inference provider key or Codex/Grok Build login for AI naming and analysis."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0ca2535e9cd3aefa16624b70b766816eb9d102ca625e13b0048fdbce44f7a110","clm_1fd614cc3c0aa6da097b4ddff74c6cdfdf6c90e08d40e958ebd47715400d9b9a","clm_25f1318024e3c5f39e490b50c2837f71d733d0fc13fae68b439dfd79956b8413","clm_30ebe052a252f4f3d418e66abc46856e4df763a60814ec8cd706a230d16b190c","clm_31fa6019a9afaeb2a140f3728cfda459cc486dbe77acef77d1f279fe087c33fe","clm_ad52f889b36563b378c4d8e21d39598c8fbd65f030586f6ad710404c5dedba7f","clm_de5e65aff50500448b78c8245d5fd64dad7ecafc4096a7681d7e636491bca986"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:13:03Z","created_by_operation":"op_bf129ea16a344358bb452a71858a433d","id":"pg_cdbeaea1fc265036814f65966aa55191","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/standardagents-dmux-readme-md-8cb3d926631a-65966aa55191.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_d5e3df68bbb354df8d87abe1d11141f1"],"title":"standardagents/dmux/README.md @ 8cb3d926631a","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:13:03Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bf129ea16a344358bb452a71858a433d"}
